  "id": "a0",
  "cell_type": "markdown",
  "status": "idle",
  "input": "# The Cayley graph of $A_5$\n\nThe rotations of an icosahedron form the alternating group\n\n$$A_5 = \\langle a, b \\mid a^5 = b^2 = (ab)^3 = 1 \\rangle$$\n\nTake $a$ a 5-cycle and $b$ a double transposition. Needs the `permutations` and `ax-plots` packages: `mxpm install permutations ax-plots`.",
  "output": null
 },
 {
  "id": "a1",
  "cell_type": "code",
  "status": "success",
  "input": "load(\"permutations\")$\nload(\"ax-plots\")$\na : [2, 3, 4, 5, 1]$\nb : [2, 1, 4, 3, 5]$\nA5 : pgrp(a, b)$\n[pgrp_order(A5), map(pgrp_element_order, [a, b, pgrp_compose(a, b)])];",
  "output": {
