 {
  "id": "a2",
  "cell_type": "markdown",
  "status": "idle",
  "input": "Its Cayley graph: a vertex for each of the 60 elements, with $a$ tracing 12 pentagons and $b$ joining them by 30 seams. Laid out by its own spectrum, it is the truncated icosahedron.",
  "output": null
 },
